# Every change to this repository requires review from a code owner.
#
# Paired with branch protection on `main` (require a pull request, 1 approving
# review, and code-owner review), this makes review by one of these accounts
# mandatory on every pull request rather than merely suggested.
#
# Both accounts belong to Nate Kot: @natekot personally, @nate-kot for work.
# Listing both is what lets a pull request opened from one be approved from the
# other -- GitHub never allows an author to approve their own pull request.
#
# Note that one approval from EITHER owner satisfies the requirement. Requiring
# both would mean raising required_approving_review_count to 2.
*       @natekot @nate-kot
